					"url": "https://x.com/bcherny/status/2007179832300581177",
					"embedType": "twitter",
					"html": "<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m Boris and I created Claude Code. Lots of people have asked how I use Claude Code, so I wanted to show off my setup a bit.<br><br>My setup might be surprisingly vanilla! Claude Code works great out of the box, so I personally don&#39;t customize it much. There is no one correct way to…</p>&mdash; Boris Cherny (@bcherny) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/bcherny/status/2007179832300581177?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 2, 2026</a></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"></script>\n\n",
					"metadata": {
						"url": "https://twitter.com/bcherny/status/2007179832300581177",
						"author_name": "Boris Cherny",
						"author_url": "https://twitter.com/bcherny",
						"html": "<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m Boris and I created Claude Code. Lots of people have asked how I use Claude Code, so I wanted to show off my setup a bit.<br><br>My setup might be surprisingly vanilla! Claude Code works great out of the box, so I personally don&#39;t customize it much. There is no one correct way to…</p>&mdash; Boris Cherny (@bcherny) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/bcherny/status/2007179832300581177?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">January 2, 2026</a></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"></script>\n\n",
						"width": 550,
						"height": null,
						"type": "twitter",
